  "about": "The results this reproduction stands on. A run started by hand reruns the pipeline (with --refit) and checks each value with tools/check_results.py; after an intended change, rerun the pipeline and update the values with --update. The refit entries expect the authors' saved optimum, so --update would replace it with ours.",
